examples.css:
.stage { height: 140px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #191825; }
button { padding: 12px 36px; border: 2px solid #865dff; background: transparent; color: #865dff; font: bold 20px sans-serif; text-transform: capitalize; cursor: pointer; }
button:hover { border-color: #d80032; color: #d80032; animation: shaking .2s linear; }
@keyframes shaking {
  0% { rotate: 20deg; }
  50% { rotate: -20deg; }
  100% { rotate: 20deg; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { button:hover { animation: none; } }

.stage { height: 220px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #191825; }
.loader { --c: #865dff; width: 120px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); position: relative; animation: circleloader 2s linear infinite reverse; }
.loader::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: #191825; }
.loader::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 50px; width: 30px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--c), 0 0 9px var(--c), 0 0 12px var(--c), 0 0 15px var(--c), 0 0 18px var(--c); }
@keyframes circleloader { 100% { rotate: 360deg; } }

.stage { height: 250px; display: grid; place-items: start center; background: #191825; padding-top: 20px; }
.cradle { width: 260px; border-top: 8px solid #865dff; border-radius: 3px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 18px; }
.cradle div { width: 3px; height: 130px; background: #865dff; position: relative; transform-origin: top center; }
.cradle div::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -12px; top: 100px; width: 27px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: #865dff; }
.cradle div:first-child { animation: left-swing 2s linear infinite; }
.cradle div:last-child { animation: right-swing 2s linear 1s infinite; }
@keyframes left-swing { 0% { rotate: 0deg; } 25% { rotate: 30deg; } 50% { rotate: 0deg; } 100% { rotate: 0deg; } }
@keyframes right-swing { 0% { rotate: 0deg; } 25% { rotate: -30deg; } 50% { rotate: 0deg; } 100% { rotate: 0deg; } }

topics.description:
Two small projects that turn plain headings into animated text.

### 1. Text reveal
**Idea**: place a copy of the text on top of the original using `::before` with `content: "SUBSCRIBE..."`. The copy has a different color, `overflow: hidden` and a right border (the caret). Animate its **width** from 0 to 100% so the colored text appears to be typed or revealed.

Key lines:
```css
h1 { position: relative; }
h1::before {
  content: "SUBSCRIBE...";
  position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
  overflow: hidden; border-right: 2px solid #e9b824;
  animation: textreveal 2s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes textreveal { 0% { width: 0; } 50% { width: 100%; } 100% { width: 0; } }
```

### 2. Floating text
A heading with a soft **text-shadow** that rocks back and forth:

```css
h1 { text-shadow: -3px 10px 10px rgba(249,141,141,.2);
     animation: textfloating 1s linear infinite alternate; }
@keyframes textfloating { 0% { rotate: 15deg; } 50% { rotate: 0deg; } 100% { rotate: -15deg; } }
```

### Concepts used
Pseudo-elements, `overflow: hidden`, `position`, keyframes, `alternate` direction, text-shadow.

### Notes
Animating `width` triggers layout; it is fine for one headline. For many elements use `clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0)` -> `inset(0)` instead.

examples.css:
.stage { height: 130px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #191825; }
.reveal { margin: 0; position: relative; color: #fff; font: bold 44px sans-serif; text-shadow: -1px 2px 3px rgba(236,247,76,.2); }
.reveal::before { content: "SUBSCRIBE..."; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; color: #e9b824; border-right: 2px solid #e9b824; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; animation: textreveal 2.5s linear infinite; }
@keyframes textreveal { 0% { width: 0; } 50% { width: 100%; } 100% { width: 0; } }

.stage { height: 170px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #191825; }
.float { margin: 0; color: #865dff; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; font: 900 38px sans-serif; text-shadow: -3px 10px 10px rgba(249,141,141,.25); animation: textfloating 1s linear infinite alternate; }
@keyframes textfloating { 0% { rotate: 15deg; } 50% { rotate: 0deg; } 100% { rotate: -15deg; } }

.sky { position: relative; height: 220px; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(#1b2735, #090a0f); font-family: sans-serif; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #cbd5e1; }
.rain { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(100deg, transparent 47%, rgba(174,194,224,.7) 50%, transparent 53%); background-size: 40px 70px; animation: raining .5s linear infinite; }
.far { background-size: 22px 40px; opacity: .45; animation-duration: .8s; }
@keyframes raining { from { background-position: 0 0; } to { background-position: -10px 70px; } }
.far { animation-name: rainingFar; }
@keyframes rainingFar { from { background-position: 0 0; } to { background-position: -6px 40px; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .rain { animation: none; } }

.stage { display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 10px; background: #ffe4d6; }
.universe { width: 220px; aspect-ratio: 1; background: #ffbb5c; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; border-radius: 12px; animation: skychange 8s ease infinite; }
@keyframes skychange { 0% { background-color: #ffbb5cb5; } 25% { background-color: #fcbf49; } 50% { background-color: #000; } 75% { background-color: #fcbf49; } 100% { background-color: #ffbb5cb5; } }
.sun { width: 100px; aspect-ratio: 1; background: #e25e3e; border-radius: 50%; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.sun::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: #000; animation: moonwalk 8s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes moonwalk {
  0% { translate: 100%; scale: 1; }
  50% { translate: 0%; scale: .95; box-shadow: rgba(255,255,255,.5) 0 48px 100px 0; }
  100% { translate: -100%; scale: .9; }
}

* { margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
.s { min-height: 220px; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center; color: #fff; font-family: sans-serif; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 100%; }
h2 { font-size: 34px; text-transform: uppercase; text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px #000; }
p { font-size: 15px; }
.s1 { background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.25), rgba(0,0,0,.25)), linear-gradient(160deg, #0f2027, #2c5364, #f7971e); background-attachment: fixed; }
.s2 { background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.25), rgba(0,0,0,.25)), linear-gradient(135deg, #614385, #516395); }
.s3 { background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.25), rgba(0,0,0,.25)), linear-gradient(160deg, #0f2027, #2c5364, #f7971e); background-attachment: fixed; }

.carousel { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 380px; height: 170px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 7px 29px rgba(100,100,111,.3); font-family: sans-serif; }
.slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font: bold 30px sans-serif; opacity: 0; animation: fade 12s linear infinite; }
.s1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f06, #fc0); animation-delay: 0s; }
.s2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2575fc, #6a11cb); animation-delay: 3s; }
.s3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00b09b, #96c93d); animation-delay: 6s; }
.s4 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff512f, #dd2476); animation-delay: 9s; }
.carousel:hover .slide { animation-play-state: paused; }
@keyframes fade { 0% { opacity: 0; } 5% { opacity: 1; } 25% { opacity: 1; } 30% { opacity: 0; } 100% { opacity: 0; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .slide { animation: none; } .s1 { opacity: 1; } }

:root { --main: #0062ff; --soft: #ebf3fe; --heading: #000a19; --para: #504e4d; --shadow: 0 7px 29px rgba(100,100,111,.2); }
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { color: var(--para); line-height: 1.5; }
.nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 20px; position: sticky; top: 0; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
.logo { color: var(--main); font-size: 20px; }
.nav nav { display: flex; gap: 16px; }
.nav a { color: var(--heading); text-decoration: none; position: relative;
  &::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: -4px; width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--main); transition: width .3s; }
  &:hover::after { width: 100%; } }
.hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: center; padding: 36px 20px; background: var(--soft); }
.hero h1 { color: var(--heading); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 1rem + 3vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 14px; padding: 10px 24px; background: var(--main); color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; transition: background .3s, box-shadow .3s; }
.btn:hover { background: #003b99; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
.hero-art { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 16px; background: conic-gradient(from 200deg at 30% 30%, #0062ff, #00bf72, #a8eb12, #0062ff); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
.features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; padding: 28px 20px; }
.features article { padding: 18px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: transform .3s; }
.features article:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.features h3 { color: var(--heading); }
footer { text-align: center; padding: 14px; background: #040d12; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; }
@media (width <= 560px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .hero-art { order: -1; } .nav nav { gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; } }
